{"version":1,"content":"<p>日本熱播諜戰劇《VIVANT》遭官媒點名批評「刻意抹黑中國」，在內地引發抵制聲浪。</p><p>擁有Hello Kitty等知名IP的日本三麗鷗（Sanrio）因與該劇推出聯乘產品亦受指摘，三麗鷗官方微博昨（28日）深夜發聲明，宣布終止合作。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-29T05:01:23.254601+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":115,"images":0,"source":"明報 中國","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-29T04:15:41+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-29T21:38:07.354299+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-29T04:58:10.704842+00:00","content_hash":"bca9a81072b8347110cf39bac4f5c2c65e8f0a6ce888f8dd6f37875b91d6e9cd","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}